invariant: INV-46
file: mlkem_lanes.h
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mlkem-vector
reason: the NEON Montgomery multiply subtracts the two doubled high
  halves and does not halve the difference, so every product leaves at
  twice its value. Only an arm64 compiler reads the line, so on an
  x86-64 machine no test binary compiles it. The script builds
  bin/mlkem_vector_equiv_test for arm64 and runs it under qemu-aarch64,
  where it holds every coefficient to mlkem_poly.c's loops. The lane
  skips without docker, and this then reports unguarded rather than
  caught.

--- old
    return vhsubq_s16(high, low);
--- new
    return vsubq_s16(high, low);
